          </div>
        </Column>
      </Container>
    </PageSection>
    <PageSection class="section-2 page-section flex-section">
      <Container class="row-2 container flex-row">
        <Column class="column-3 column flex-column blend-normal width-6-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-6-24-wide-tablet">
          <div class="icon-8 icon-block block flex-block">
            <span class="icon-frame">
              <span class="icon"></span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <Heading class="heading-8 block flex-block" level={4}>
            ORDER
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-9 block flex-block" level={3}>
            €486.60
          </Heading>
        </Column>
        <Column class="column-4 column flex-column blend-normal width-6-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-6-24-wide-tablet">
          <div class="icon-9 icon-block block flex-block">
            <span class="icon-frame">
              <span class="icon"></span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <Heading class="heading-10 block flex-block" level={4}>
            SCOPE
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-11 block flex-block" level={3}>
            11 pages
          </Heading>
        </Column>
        <Column class="column-5 column flex-column blend-normal width-6-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-6-24-wide-tablet">
          <div class="icon-10 icon-block block flex-block">
            <span class="icon-frame">
              <span class="icon"></span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <Heading class="heading-12 block flex-block" level={4}>
            WORKFLOW
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-13 block flex-block" level={3}>
            Staging → Live
          </Heading>
        </Column>
        <Column class="column-6 column last-column flex-column blend-normal width-6-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-6-24-wide-tablet">
          <div class="icon-11 icon-block block flex-block">
            <span class="icon-frame">
              <span class="icon"></span>
            </span>
          </div>
          <Heading class="heading-14 block flex-block" level={4}>
            PROOF
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-15 block flex-block" level={3}>
            Trustindex reviews
          </Heading>
        </Column>
      </Container>
    </PageSection>
    <PageSection class="section-3 page-section flex-section">
      <Container class="row-3 container flex-row">
        <Column class="column-7 column last-column flex-column blend-normal width-24-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-24-24-wide-tablet">
          <Heading class="heading-16 block flex-block" level={2}>
            FROM THE ARCHIVE CARD
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-17 block flex-block" level={2}>
            The homepage summary, expanded into the full project brief.
          </Heading>
          <TextBlock class="copy-2 copy-block tone-light block flex-block">
            <p>
              The same core information visitors first see on the homepage card is carried into the
              full case study so the transition stays consistent.
            </p>
          </TextBlock>
        </Column>
      </Container>
      <Container class="row-4 container flex-row">
        <Column class="column-8 column flex-column blend-normal width-12-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-12-24-wide-tablet">
          <Heading class="heading-18 block flex-block" level={4}>
            BUSINESS FOCUS
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-19 block flex-block" level={3}>
            Modernize a live security-company website without discarding established brand equity.
          </Heading>
          <TextBlock class="copy-3 copy-block tone-light block flex-block">
            <p>
              Improve structure, mobile behaviour, trust, on-page SEO and performance while
              preserving the red already used across vehicles, flyers and other offline brand
              materials.
            </p>
          </TextBlock>
        </Column>
        <Column class="column-9 column last-column flex-column blend-normal width-12-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-12-24-wide-tablet">
          <Heading class="heading-20 block flex-block" level={4}>
            SYSTEM DELIVERED
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-21 block flex-block" level={3}>
            An 11-page WordPress redesign combining staging, responsive rebuild, SEO, proof
            integrations and controlled migration.
          </Heading>
          <TextBlock class="copy-4 copy-block tone-light block flex-block">
            <p>
              11-page redesign on staging; responsive refinement; heading hierarchy and metadata
              cleanup; image optimization; manufacturer logos and video; Trustindex Google reviews;
              and final migration into production.
            </p>
          </TextBlock>
        </Column>
      </Container>
      <Container class="row-5 container flex-row">
        <Column class="column-10 column flex-column blend-normal width-10-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-10-24-wide-tablet">
          <Heading class="heading-22 block flex-block" level={4}>
            PROJECT TECHNOLOGIES
          </Heading>
          <div class="group-11 block flex-group blend-normal">
            <div class="group-12 block flex-group blend-normal">
              <div class="icon-12 icon-block block flex-block">
                <span class="icon-frame">
                  <span class="icon"></span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <Heading class="heading-23 block flex-block" level={4}>
                WordPress
              </Heading>
            </div>
            <div class="group-13 block flex-group blend-normal">
              <div class="icon-13 icon-block block flex-block">
                <span class="icon-frame">
                  <span class="icon"></span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <Heading class="heading-24 block flex-block" level={4}>
                On-page SEO
              </Heading>
            </div>
            <div class="group-14 last-column block flex-group blend-normal">
              <div class="icon-14 icon-block block flex-block">
                <span class="icon-frame">
                  <span class="icon"></span>
                </span>
              </div>
              <Heading class="heading-25 block flex-block" level={4}>
                Trustindex
              </Heading>
            </div>
          </div>
          <TextBlock class="copy-5 copy-block tone-light block flex-block">
            <p>These mirror the Technology 1–3 fields used by the homepage case-study card.</p>
          </TextBlock>
        </Column>
        <Column class="column-11 column last-column flex-column blend-normal width-14-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-14-24-wide-tablet">
          <Heading class="heading-26 block flex-block" level={4}>
            VERIFIED OUTCOME
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-27 block flex-block" level={3}>
            €486.60 REPEAT-CLIENT ORDER
          </Heading>
          <TextBlock class="copy-6 copy-block tone-light block flex-block">
            <p>
              The buyer returned after Bau-Helden and commissioned a significantly larger 11-page
              redesign. The client explained:{' '}
              <strong style="color:#f5f7fc">
                “I accepted your price after seeing that the work on Bau-Helden matched what I
                needed. I hired you for another website.”
              </strong>
            </p>
          </TextBlock>
        </Column>
      </Container>
    </PageSection>
    <PageSection class="section-4 page-section flex-section">
      <Container class="row-6 container flex-row">
        <Column class="column-12 column last-column flex-column blend-normal width-24-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-24-24-wide-tablet">
          <Heading class="heading-28 block flex-block" level={2}>
