        </Column>
      </Container>
    </PageSection>
    <PageSection class="section-5 page-section flex-section">
      <Container class="row-8 container flex-row">
        <Column class="column-15 column last-column flex-column blend-normal width-24-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-24-24-wide-tablet">
          <Heading class="heading-32 block flex-block" level={2}>
            SOLUTION ARCHITECTURE
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-33 block flex-block" level={2}>
            Five layers turned a legacy site into a more complete business system.
          </Heading>
          <TextBlock class="copy-16 copy-block tone-light block flex-block">
            <p>
              The redesign combined brand continuity, service structure, proof, SEO and controlled
