      <Container class="row-11 container flex-row">
        <Column class="column-20 column last-column flex-column blend-normal width-24-24 width-24-24-tablet width-24-24-phone width-24-24-wide-tablet">
          <Heading class="heading-47 block flex-block" level={2}>
            DELIVERY WORKFLOW
          </Heading>
          <Heading class="heading-48 block flex-block" level={2}>
            Move the redesign off production, then reconnect everything safely.
